<title>UK: BayerLB sets C$100 mln six-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets C$100 mln six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and ScotiaMcleod.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    24.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.845   PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.245    SPREAD	+34 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT CANADIAN BOND DUE SEP.01</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UD/UK/VS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
